{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54065","headline":"偈 二 · 正原","name":"偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻师认得本心源，两岸俱玄一不全。\n是佛何（一作「不」）须更求（一作「觅」）佛，只因从（一作「如」）此便忘言（一作「缘」）。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十七、《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四。\n注「一作」者爲後二书之异文。\n《淳熙三山志》卷三七以前一首爲释智真作，今不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"正原","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}